  "description": "Sands of Skullcreek is a short, retro style FPS game that rides the line between shoot-em-up action and tactical weapon combat, and is inspired by classic shooters of the early 3D era and classic western movies.  Play from beginning to end a single session, or dive deeper to find hidden secrets or improve your score.\n\nPlay the role of the heretofore negligent sheriff of Skullcreek, and engage in intense cowboy shootouts as he earns his redemption. Use every weapon at your disposal--knife, shotgun, rifle, and trusty revolver--to blast your way through these dusty, hand-crafted streets and face the showdown at the end of the road.",
  "description_short": "Shoot it out against crazed bandits in order to save this Old Western town from destruction in this single-sitting, retro-style first person shooter.",
